55:09.800 --> 55:12.140
<i> para maghanapbuhay,</i>
<i> alam mo, kaya...</i>

55:12.242 --> 55:15.440
<i> Um, inaabangan ko</i>
<i> ang Linggo.</i>

55:15.542 --> 55:17.775
<i> Sa tingin ko ito ay magiging
maganda.</i>

55:17.877 --> 55:19.743
STEPHEN QUADROS:<i>Kaya hindi lang</i>
<i>naririto si Mark Coleman</i>

55:19.845 --> 55:22.284
